## Interface: 11509, 20506, 30403, 100007
## Title: |cff888888VoiceOver Redux|r (now Spoken Quests)
## Notes: This addon was renamed to Spoken Quests. Its settings are migrated on first login; after that this folder can be deleted.
## Version: 2.0.0
## SavedVariables: VoiceOverDB
## LoadSavedVariablesFirst: true
## X-Part-Of: Spoken
# A tombstone: no Lua at all. The client names a SavedVariables file after the addon
# folder, so renaming the folder would orphan every player's settings. This folder exists
# only to keep VoiceOverRedux.lua loading long enough for SpokenQuests to copy it, and to
# overwrite the old addon's code when a manager installs the new release over it.
